# The pre-split .env, removed 2026-08-28. The three files that replaced it
# (.env.bridge, .env.docker, .env.admin) are tracked; a bare .env is not, so a
# local scratch copy cannot drift back into the repo.
/.env

# Vite's local overrides. `.env.local` is per-developer by convention and by name —
# which stack you happen to be pointed at, and (via VITE_AUTH) which credential that
# broker accepts. `.env.compose.example` is the tracked copy worth reading.
web-consumer/.env.local
web-consumer/.env.*.local
libzb/soak-uids.txt
libzb/zbz-*.sqlite3*
